Source: zl-agent
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ZealLab LLC <info@zeallab.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/ZealLab-LLC/ZL_Agent

Package: zl-agent
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, zl-tools
Description: ZealLab Agent - local-only development agent for ZealLabOS
 A local-only development agent (fork of OpenCode) that runs entirely
 against a local Ollama daemon.
 No cloud account, no API key, and no outbound network access during normal
 use - you choose from whatever models you have pulled locally.
 .
 Installed as a subcommand of the zl dispatcher and invoked as "zl agent"
 (works only if zl-agent is installed).
 .
 Ollama is expected to be installed and running already; this package does
 not install or manage it.
